0 30 444 [
[(You can use the "onset" inlet to [tabread4~] to get good accuracy reading longer arrays.)]
[(The [tabread4~] object adds the index and the "main" \050signal\051 inlet in double precision.)]
[(So if, for example, the onset inlet could specify an integer exactly up to about 8)]
[(million \050174 seconds at 48000 Hz\051, and the signal inlet could act as a displacement.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
